# Living Server (docs/LIVING-SERVER.md): grats, rez requests and thanks, corpse runs, resurrection
# sickness, server firsts, frontier alarms, nemesis, sessions (logging on and off, breaks) and
# linkdeads. New writing for this project, in the voice of 2002-2003 players.
# Slots: {target} the one being congratulated or rezzed, {killer}/{killer_class} the race and class
# of the enemy who killed the speaker, {size} a rough head count, {classes} what was seen, {place} where.

# ---- Grats: another character dinged ------------------------------------------------------------
@kind grats
@who *
grats {target}
gz {target}
grats!
gz
nice, grats {target}
gratz
gz gz
grats, long road
grats {target}, go train
@kind grats
@needs in_group
@who *
grats {target}, good group
gz {target}, keep it going
@needs in_group, xp_high
ding grats, one more and i am there too
@needs in_group
@kind grats
@topic fifty
@who *
GRATS {target}!! 50!
gz on 50 {target}, see you in the frontier
grats {target}, welcome to the end of the grind
50! huge grats {target}
@who Socialite
grats {target}!! we need a party for that one
@who NoLifer
gz {target}. now the real game starts
@who Leveler
grats {target}, how long did that take, /played?

