# ---- Nemesis -------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Enemy names are hidden in the frontier, so {killer} is the killer's race and {killer_class} its
# class as the speaker's realm would see them ("that troll berserker").
@kind nemesis
@who *
that {killer} {killer_class} again. has it out for me
